// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1850474526" "The situation in the office building has been taken care of, thanks to you. Now, we must return our attention to breaking up the Nictus's alliances within the Council. If we can now get Nosferatu to change sides, the Nictus's coup will fail for certain."
// RandomFameString :
"P85240338" "My buddy's office was filled with those Council maniacs. He thought he was done for, but then in came {HeroName} to lay down the law."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
