// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bransen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2499120496" "Defeat Archon Bransen"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1753886475" "You defeated Archon Bransen, weakening the base's defenders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Files 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1589839875" "You planted the evidence for Nosferatu to find."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2664201214" "You planted the evidence, but we haven't seen any change. Maybe Nosferatu didn't find it? Maybe Arakhn had an agent in place who found it first? I don't know. Something's gone wrong, and unless we find it and fix it, the Nictus could win with Nosferatu's help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Kheldian_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1457780979" "We found out why Nosferatu didn't change sides after you planted the evidence of the plot against him. He already knew about the plot. We received this: <br><br>'{HeroName}<br>I thank you for your concern, but to tell the truth, I am somewhat interested in becoming a Nictus. Unlike Vandal, I do not see that as a kind of death, but as an interesting new state of being. <br>However, I am not locked into the idea. I would like to see just how good you Kheldians really are. Also, I could use a good fight to test the limits of the work I've done on my own body. So, let us arrange a simple test: If you can defeat me and allow me to remain free, I will change sides in this struggle and assist the Center. Until you do, I shall support Requiem, and by extension Arakhn and the Nictus. I have enclosed a location I can be found at. <br>Bring allies. <br>You will need them.<br>-Nosferatu' <br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>If we want to stop the Nictus insurrection, you're going to have to defeat an Arch-villain.</A> Can you handle it?"
// AcceptString :
"P3646257659" "Change Nosferatu's mind by force"
// SendOffString :
"P589156759" "Nosferatu is the first of the Vampyri, and is still the strongest. He's used all of his experimental techniques on himself first. On top of that, he has over half a century of experience and cunning on his side. Bring all the allies you can, he won't give any quarter."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P228683703" "Defeat Nosferatu"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2919816399" "Bring all the allies you can for this. Nosferatu won't give any quarter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P726012887" "A feeling of dread washes over you as you set foot in this darkest of places."

