// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3666994947" "I am waiting, {HeroName}. I hope that this battle will be a good one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2403032398" "I have been following your exploits, {HeroName}. I hope your abilities were not overstated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Nosferatu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4039743263" "After the battle, Nosferatu had some things to tell you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2958880351" "You defeated Nosferatu, convincing him to switch sides!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P632167108" "Nosferatu was true to his word. The Vampyri are switching sides, and the Nictus are on the defensive. The Center should be able to put down the rebellion on his own now. However, this gives us an opportunity to check out what Nosferatu told you about this 'place where the Nictus keep secrets'. Give us some time to make sure it's not a trap, and then let's see if we can discover what Nosferatu was hinting at."
// RandomFameString :
"P3260220353" "I heard Nosferatu called out {HeroName} and got himself beat down!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Kheldian_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2035923980" "Arakhn and Requiem's rebellion is ending. Now that Vandal and Nosferatu have turned against them, the Nictus no longer have the forces to defeat the Center. Speaking of Nosferatu, the location he told you about doesn't seem to be a Council base. It wasn't anyplace we'd heard of. It seems to be some natural caverns out around Peregrine Island and nothing more. However, there are reports coming in from the Coast Guard of Council troops fighting Nictus in the area. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Nosferatu may have been telling the truth, but the only way to find out is to investigate</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1198719927" "Investigate the caves Nosferatu told you about"
// SendOffString :
"P3459500613" "Nosferatu said that there were secrets in those caves, but not what kind of secrets, or who guarded them. If the Center's troops are moving on the same location then we can assume that Nosferatu also told him about these secrets, and that the Center thinks it's important enough to send forces out there. You must capture those secrets, and then keep them safe by defeating any opponents in those caverns who could reveal that we what we found."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1061789728" "Clear secret caves"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3243153109" "You must find the secrets that Nosferatu talked about and clear the caves out so that neither the Nictus nor the Center know what we've found."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3881358742" "These caves are dry and cool. Their ancient silence is broken by the sounds of gunfire."

